---
source: flick/tests/help_command.rs
expression: "stdout(&[\"help\", \"fmt\"])"
---
Format Flick source files in place

Usage: flick fmt [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...  Files, or directories to search for `.fl` files

Options:
      --check                      Only check: exit with 1 if a file is not formatted, write nothing
      --diagnostics <DIAGNOSTICS>  Format of diagnostics on stderr [default: human] [possible values: human, json]
      --color <COLOR>              Colorize human-readable output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --stdin                      Format source from stdin to stdout (for editors)
      --quiet                      Print less service output
      --stdin-filepath <FILE>      Path of the `--stdin` source, used in diagnostics. Requires `--stdin`
      --verbose                    Print more service output
  -h, --help                       Print help
